/**
 * Every merchant's shop stock as the server sells it, one look per line (group, number, level,
 * excellent): a snapshot of the live server DB, 2026-11-26, generated by
 * `~/workspace/fix-glow-097/slice3/generate-shop-stock.mjs` from `shop-stock-live.csv`
 * (MonsterDefinition -> MerchantStoreId -> ItemStorage -> Item -> ItemDefinition) and
 * `merchant-maps-live.csv` (MonsterSpawnArea -> GameMapDefinition). No shop sells an ancient
 * item, so no look carries `isAncient`.
 *
 * The snapshot only decides WHAT to warm early: the shop window itself still takes its stock
 * from the server's StoreItemList packet when it opens, so a stock change on the server
 * never shows a wrong item here - at worst a new look warms on open instead of at world
 * entry, and a removed look warms a picture nobody asks for. Re-run the generator after a
 * server stock change to keep the warm-up exact.
 */
